@0 = ~Sorcerer/Monk multiclass for GemRB~
@1 = ~sorcerer/monk~
@2 = ~SORCERER/MONK:

A lawful multiclass combining spontaneous arcane spellcasting with a monk's unarmed combat, movement, defenses and class abilities.

The class uses split multiclass progression, Sorcerer spell selection, Monk fists and Monk class abilities. It is restricted to humans and lawful alignments. Item restrictions from both Sorcerer/Mage and Monk are applied.

Dual-classing is not supported. The class requires GemRB and cannot be used with the original Infinity Engine executable.~
@3 = ~Sorcerer/Monk~
@4 = ~Run this game with GemRB at least once before installing. WeiDU could not find gemrb_path.txt.~
@5 = ~This release supports BG2, ToB, BGT, BG2EE and EET installations running through GemRB.~
@6 = ~Required modern GemRB class tables are missing. Update GemRB, run it once on this game installation, and retry.~
@7 = ~No free 8-bit class identifier is available. Remove conflicting custom-class mods before installing.~
@8 = ~A lawful spontaneous arcane caster trained in unarmed combat and monastic disciplines.~
